<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.jackharvest.7sense</id>
  <name>7Sense</name>
  <summary>Real extraction progress for Linux archive tools</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      7Sense sits in your system tray and shows real extraction progress —
      actual percentages and time remaining — for 7-Zip, tar, zip, and RAR.
      No changes to your existing tools required. Around 4 MB RAM at idle.
    </p>
    <p>
      A short setup wizard walks you through everything on first launch.
      After that, 7Sense lives in your tray and stays out of your way.
    </p>
  </description>
  <developer>
